avs-cd N/GeneticSpecies
FailAt 21
IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:GeneticSpecies
  makedir WHDSaves:GeneticSpecies
ENDIF
IF EXISTS WHDSaves:GeneticSpecies/Genetic.SavedGame
  copy WHDSaves:GeneticSpecies/Genetic.SavedGame S:Genetic.SavedGame QUIET
ENDIF
IF EXISTS WHDSaves:GeneticSpecies/Genetic.Prefs
  copy WHDSaves:GeneticSpecies/Genetic.Prefs ENVARC:Genetic.Prefs QUIET
ENDIF
assign Genetics: ""
assign LIBS: Genetics:Libs ADD
assign DEVS: Genetics:Install/AHI/User/Devs ADD
Genetics:C/AddAudioModes FILES Genetics:Install/AHI/User/Devs/AudioModes/PAULA QUIET
stack >NIL: 262144
cd Genetics:GeneticSpecies
GeneticSpecies.Exe
IF EXISTS S:Genetic.SavedGame
  copy S:Genetic.SavedGame WHDSaves:GeneticSpecies/Genetic.SavedGame QUIET
ENDIF
IF EXISTS ENVARC:Genetic.Prefs
  copy ENVARC:Genetic.Prefs WHDSaves:GeneticSpecies/Genetic.Prefs QUIET
ENDIF
assign LIBS: Genetics:Libs REMOVE
assign DEVS: Genetics:Install/AHI/User/Devs REMOVE
assign Genetics: REMOVE
FailAt 10
